{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>遊戲計劃於2026年11月5日發售，屆時正值《塞爾達傳説》系列40周年。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"任天堂公佈《塞爾達傳説：時之笛》重製版兩支日本宣傳片 展示此前未公開畫面\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261016/1792129799_144524_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>配套的主題主機與Pro手柄據稱安排在10月29日推出，另有兩款amiibo計劃於2027年上市。</p>\n<p>西班牙亞馬遜已將遊戲預購價下調至59.90歐元，所列優惠幅度為14%。</p>\n\n<p>\n<img alt=\"任天堂公佈《塞爾達傳説：時之笛》重製版兩支日本宣傳片 展示此前未公開畫面\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261016/1792129799_144524_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T08:00:04.187368+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":2,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T07:53:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T03:38:00.604730+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:57:36.463659+00:00","content_hash":"8056b0c59a83512d30ef8b5f0b05dbc4ad7d8366f3117f97726ae274d8b0bbb7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}